                    <div class="consent-list-item">
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1D9E75" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                        <span style="font-size:0.95rem; font-weight:500; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">تفاعلك مع أزرار وخصائص اللانشر</span>
